#: components/HomePage.vue:85
msgid ""
"Are you a journalist? Start making money by publishing content or as a "
"newspaper editor."
msgstr ""

#: components/HomePage.vue:87
msgid "@homepage/editors"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"We enjoy design and technology. <strong>We create a unique platform for you "
"journalists \n"
"and your readers</strong>. You concentrate on what you are good at - good "
"content. \n"
"</p> \n"
"\n"
"<p><strong>Found a newspaper and start selecting the best articles and "
"tweets</strong> \n"
"for the next release across all of authors on Kairly. For your interesting "
"content \n"
"your <strong>readers will be paying you monthly subscription</strong>. \n"
"</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Readers can also subscribe to you as the author. Other editors can include "
"your articles  \n"
"in their newspaper releases. <strong>This will also give you a share from "
"the newspaper's  \n"
"subscriptions in which your articles appeared</strong>. \n"
"</p> \n"

#: components/HomePage.vue:109
msgid "@homepage/quote/roman"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"The paid content is spoken for years, but the current models of pay-wall are "
"waiting for success. \n"
"Journalists are still dependent on the advertising duopoly of Google and "
"Facebook. \n"
"As a result, the redundancy of editorial staff and the cost reduction are "
"continually being achieved. \n"
"There is basically no time for doing good journalism. \n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Our concept of paid content goes much further than an ordinary pay-"
"wall. \n"
"We use the principles of absolute openness and network effect that social "
"networks have been using for years. \n"
"That is why we believe that Kairly brings a promising model of paid content "
"on the Internet. \n"
"</p> \n"

#: components/HomePage.vue:132
msgid "Check out some of our newspapers."
msgstr ""

#: components/HomePage.vue:144 pages/journalists.vue:19 pages/publishers.vue:26
#: pages/readers.vue:20 pages/think-tanks.vue:26
msgid "Was said about us."
msgstr ""

#: components/HomePage.vue:147 pages/journalists.vue:19 pages/publishers.vue:26
#: pages/readers.vue:20 pages/think-tanks.vue:26
msgid "@homepage/quote/zouzalik"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"Nowadays, when attacks on journalists, including physical ones, are "
"increasing, we need to find a \n"
"sustainable economic model for journalism. Only in this way can we keep "
"independent journalism on \n"
"politicians and large private corporations. And only in this way we can "
"resist the phenomena of fake \n"
"news and ensure that the complete freedom of speech is preserved. \n"
"</p> \n"
" \n"
"<p> \n"
"Kairly comes up with an interesting concept of paid content on the internet, "
"which is significantly \n"
"different from the current not very successful attempts. \n"
"</p> \n"

