#: pages/journalists.vue:45 pages/think-tanks.vue:52
msgid "Publish on a modern platform that you do not have to worry about."
msgstr ""

#: pages/journalists.vue:47 pages/think-tanks.vue:55
msgid "@independent-journalists/modern-platform"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"We are creating a modern digital platform that is tailored to journalists "
"and publicists. \n"
"We offer readers an environment for uninterrupted reading, whether they use "
"a computer, a \n"
"mobile, a tablet, or an ebook in the future. \n"
"</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"We are lovers of good old paper newspapers and magazines. The design "
"platform combines the  \n"
"best of the era of printed periodicals and modern UX trends of today's "
"mobile and web applications. \n"
"</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"On the platform you can publish for free. As soon as the readers begin to "
"pay you, \n"
"we will charge 15% of the subscription price. \n"
"</p> \n"

#: pages/journalists.vue:64 pages/publishers.vue:58 pages/readers.vue:72
#: pages/think-tanks.vue:90
msgid "@independent-journalists/quote/jan-mikula"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"For journalists, journalists, and bloggers, we are creating an open platform "
"inspired by, \n"
"social networks where authors will be fairly competing who can inform "
"readers in the best and most interesting way. \n"
"</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Nowadays, with an infinite stream of insignificant information and "
"constantly disturbing notifications,we create an environment for readers to "
"read, what they really want to read, and when they are used to read.The "
"time, when we bought a newspaper and read them on the bus had, wasn't bad at "
"all.</p> \n"

#: pages/journalists.vue:87 pages/think-tanks.vue:113
msgid "Start monetizing your content and become a truly independent author."
msgstr ""

#: pages/journalists.vue:89 pages/think-tanks.vue:116
msgid "@independent-journalists/monetizing-content"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"Advertising can't pay for quality content. Readers must learn to pay again "
"for quality content. \n"
" We must be clever about it. Join our unique system for paid content. \n"
"</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Readers can either subscribe directly to you or subscribe to newspapers from "
"editors who consider \n"
"your articles and tweets to be good and put them in their issues. \n"
"</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"If you are writing an particularly interesting content, readers have the "
"opportunity to send  \n"
"you extra money above the normal subscription. \n"
"</p> \n"

#: pages/journalists.vue:108 pages/publishers.vue:87 pages/readers.vue:120
#: pages/think-tanks.vue:154
msgid "@independent-journalists/quote/roman-krejcik"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"Advertising does not pay for high-quality journalism. Especially when we "
"have a duopoly of Google and Facebook. \n"
"Paid content is returning. But there are lots of troubles. Most current "
"attempts are not very successful. We have to be smarter about it. \n"
"</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Let's take advantage of what social networks have done so well. Kairly uses "
"princples of absolute openness and network effect,  \n"
"allowing readers to really read only what they want, and from the authors "
"across the platform. This high personalization of the content \n"
"is the key to a successful paid content model. \n"
"</p> \n"

#: pages/journalists.vue:164
msgid "Digital Publishing Platform for Journalists and Bloggers"
msgstr ""

#: pages/journalists.vue:169
msgid ""
"Kairly is a digital publishing platform for independent journalists and "
"bloggers who wants to start earning money for writing good content."
msgstr ""

#: pages/publishers.vue:6
msgid "Are you an independent publisher?"
msgstr ""

#: pages/publishers.vue:15
msgid "Publish your newspapers and magazines on a modern platform."
msgstr ""

#: pages/publishers.vue:16
msgid ""
"Start earning on your publications with a unique concept of paid content."
msgstr ""

#: pages/publishers.vue:17
msgid "Reach new audiences."
msgstr ""

#: pages/publishers.vue:52
msgid ""
"Publish your newspapers and magazines on a modern platform and reach out to "
"new readers."
msgstr ""

#: pages/publishers.vue:54
msgid "@publishers/modern-platform"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"Focus on what you're good at. On publishing content. We will make sure that "
"your content reaches the readers in the best possible form, whether they are "
"on a computer, mobile, tablet or ebooks.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"We are lovers of good old paper newspapers and magazines. The platform "
"design combines the best of the era of printed periodicals and modern UX "
"trends from today's mobile and web applications.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Our unique concept of digital newspapers lets you reach new readers. Greater "
"possibilities for personalization of content, as well as regularity of "
"publishing, lead to the formation of readers' habits and thus more loyalty "
"to your publications.</p> \n"

#: pages/publishers.vue:81
msgid "Make money on your publications with a unique concept of paid content."
msgstr ""

#: pages/publishers.vue:83
msgid "@publishers/monetizing-content"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"Advertising can't pay good content. Readers need to learn to pay for quality "
"content again. We have to be smart about it. Engage your publishing company "
"in our unique paid content system.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Publish your titles through our unique concept of digital newspapers and "
"start publishing new, more focused titles to help you reach new readers "
"through the personalization and that will increase the likelihood of buying "
"a monthly subscription.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Thanks to the openness of the entire platform, your original content may "
"also appear in the edition of the other editors' newspaper. You will then "
"receive a fair monetaryreward from the newspaper's subscription where your "
"post appeared.</p> \n"

#: pages/publishers.vue:142
msgid "Digital Publishing Platform for Publishers"
msgstr ""

#: pages/publishers.vue:147
msgid ""
"Kairly is a digital publishing platform for publishers that offers a unique "
"concept of paid content."
msgstr ""

#: pages/readers.vue:6
msgid "Are you a news reader?"
msgstr ""

#: pages/readers.vue:9
msgid ""
"Stop endlessly scrolling without thinking. Read only what you really care "
"about."
msgstr ""

#: pages/readers.vue:10
msgid ""
"Don't be bothered by nonsense notifications. Read only when you want and "
"when you're used to it."
msgstr ""

#: pages/readers.vue:11
msgid "Support high-quality journalists by purchasing a subscription."
msgstr ""

#: pages/readers.vue:46
msgid ""
"Read on the platform where there is only content that interests you and no "
"one is disturbing you there."
msgstr ""

#: pages/readers.vue:49
msgid "@readers/modern-platform"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"In today's world of social networks and countless apps that constantly "
"demand your attention, we are building a place for you where you can only "
"read what interests you.</p> \n"
"<p>We are nostalgically looking back to the paper newspaper, where one did "
"not have to scroll forever. With each turn of the paper, the reader got a "
"perfectly edited content by a professional editor. This experience is "
"missing on the Internet.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"Our unique concept of digital newspaper offers readers highly personalized "
"content that is as well professionaly prepared. Our app does not lead to "
"addiction, but it creates good reading news habits.</p> \n"

#: pages/readers.vue:95
msgid ""
"By purchasing digital newspapers, you help good journalists and publicists."
msgstr ""

#: pages/readers.vue:97
msgid "@readers/monetizing-content"
msgstr ""
"<p> \n"
"Advertising can't pay high-quality journalists. If journalists are "
"predominantly dependent on advertising, they will write content that is "
"primarily about clicks. We are concerned with quality, so on our platform "
"readers pay for content.</p> \n"
"<p>By purchasing a digital newspaper subscription, you support editors with "
"good choice of articles and tweets. You are also helping authors who appear "
"in your prepaid newspaper.</p> \n"
"<p> \n"
"You can support your favorite authors, think-tanks or non-profit "
"organizations beyond your regular subscription.</p> \n"

#: pages/readers.vue:175
msgid "Media platform for readers"
msgstr ""

#: pages/readers.vue:180
msgid ""
"Kairly is a media platform for pleasant reading without distraction and "
"endless scrolling."
msgstr ""

#: pages/think-tanks.vue:209
